{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(1) Introduction to the game This is a casual story - based game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You take part in the company's daily work. Just click on the computer to work (play small games). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing these small games can get you gold coins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You use the gold coins to unlock and move the story forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Players can walk around in different places. This will start different parts of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > (2) Small game gameplay Use the wasd keys on the keyboard to move around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Control well. The more layers there are under the ball, the better. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll get your rewards when the timer runs out.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3607000?t=1759765194","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3607000?t=1759765194","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607000/7022fe9efd059db94f34f3c3d2f3df996d2b5314/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759765194","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607000/7022fe9efd059db94f34f3c3d2f3df996d2b5314/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759765194","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(1) Introduction to the game This is a casual story - based game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You take part in the company's daily work. Just click on the computer to work (play small games). </p><p class=\"bb_p